      "description": "First project-side statement on the crashing row that materializes attacker-controlled row bytes into vulnerability-relevant heap state. After the valid matrix header has admitted this loader, `vips_sbuf_get_line_copy()` copies the current untrusted data row into heap buffer `line`."
