      "fine_trace_step": 6,
      "description": "ASan-observed sink. The error formatter expands `bad number \"%s\"` with the dangling token pointer forwarded from `matrixload`, so `vips_vsnprintf` dereferences freed row-buffer bytes while formatting the `%s` argument."
